          "text": "naṁdipādē namastubhyaṁ śaṁkarārdha śarīriṇi, sarvalōka hitētubhyaṁ bhīmaratyai namōstu te, yamunā aṁtargata bhārati ramaṇa mukhya prāṇāṁtargata jayāvade saṁkarṣaṇāya namaḥ, ābharaṇīyaṁ samarpayāmi.\n\nābharaṇārthē akṣatān samarpayāmi.\n\nsahyapāda samudbhūtē sarvakāmaphalapradē, sarvalakṣaṇasaṁyuktē bhavanāśitē namaḥ.\n\nyamunā aṁtargata bhārati ramaṇa mukhya prāṇāṁtargata saṁkarṣaṇāya namaḥ, uttarīyārthē akṣatān samarpayāmi."
