          "text": "kr̥ṣṇapāda samudbhūtē gaṁgē tripathagāmini, jaṭājūṭa samudbhūtē sarvakāmaphalapradē.\n\nyamunā dēvyai namaḥ, gaṁdhārthē akṣatān samarpayāmi.\n\ngōdāvari namastubhyaṁ sarvābhīṣṭapradāyini, śrīkr̥ṣṇa jagadvaṁdyē akṣatān avalāṁ śubhān.\n\nyamunā aṁtargata bhārati ramaṇa mukhya prāṇāṁtargata jayāvadi saṁkarṣaṇāya namaḥ, akṣatān samarpayāmi.\n\nmaṁdāraiḥ pārijātaiśca pāṭalā śōkacaṁpakaiḥ, pūjayāmi tava prītyai varadē bhaktavatsale."
