          "text": "ōṁ gaṇānāṁ tvā gaṇapatiṁ havāmahē kaviṁ kavīnāmupamaśravastamaṁ |\njyēṣṭharājaṁ brahmaṇāṁ brahmaṇaspata ā naḥ śr̥ṇvannūtibhiḥ sīda sādanam |\nōṁ bhūḥ.\n\ngaṇapatyaṁtarda bhāratī mukhya prāṇāṁtara viṣṇu brahmāvāhayāmi.\n\nōṁ bhuvaḥ.\n\ngaṇapatyaṁtarda bhāratī mukhya prāṇāṁtara viṣṇu brahmāvāhayāmi.\n\nōṁ svaḥ.\n\ngaṇapatyaṁtarda bhāratī mukhya prāṇāṁtara viṣṇu brahmāvāhayāmi.\n\nōṁ bhūrbhuvaḥ svaḥ.\n\ngaṇapatyaṁtarda bhāratī mukhya prāṇāṁtara viṣṇu brahmāvāhayāmi."
